{"format":"kards-original-reference","version":1,"id":"0bfca576f9611d13","name":"card_unit_type_88_aa_gun","package":"/Game/Blueprints/Cards/Japan/Base/units/card_unit_type_88_aa_gun","parent":"UBaseCardObject","card":{"title":"TYPE 88 AA GUN","text":"Air units that attack or are attacked by TYPE 88 AA GUN are pinned.","flavorText":"The Type 88 75 mm AA gun was a Japanese anti-aircraft gun used by the Imperial Japanese Army from 1927 to 1945. It was first designed as a medium anti-aircraft weapon, but the Japanese forces soon found out that it was a very effective anti-tank weapon when it was fired horizontally. During WWII, both in the Battle of Iwo Jima and the Battle of Okinawa, it was used effectively against American M4 Sherman tanks, and as a coastal-defense gun. By the end of the war many of the guns were withdrawn from front line services and used for Japan's homeland defenses against Allied air raids and to prepare for the threat of the Allied invasion.","faction":"Japan","type":"artillery","rarity":"Common","cost":2,"operationCost":1,"attack":1,"defense":3},"defaults":{"UberGraphFrame":{},"Name":"card_unit_type_88_aa_gun","title":{"Namespace":"card_japan","Key":"card_unit_type_88_aa_gun_title","SourceString":"TYPE 88 AA GUN","LocalizedString":"TYPE 88 AA GUN"},"Type":"ETypeEnum::artillery","attack":1,"defense":3,"range":2,"faction":"EFactionEnum::Japan","kredits":2,"Text":{"Namespace":"card_japan","Key":"card_unit_type_88_aa_gun_text","SourceString":"Air units that attack or are attacked by TYPE 88 AA GUN are pinned.","LocalizedString":"Air units that attack or are attacked by TYPE 88 AA GUN are pinned."},"flavorText":{"Namespace":"card_japan","Key":"card_unit_type_88_aa_gun_history","SourceString":"The Type 88 75 mm AA gun was a Japanese anti-aircraft gun used by the Imperial Japanese Army from 1927 to 1945. It was first designed as a medium anti-aircraft weapon, but the Japanese forces soon found out that it was a very effective anti-tank weapon when it 